@startuml
title Slice 1: 学習フローの中核クラス図
caption 生徒が課題に取り組み、コードログと提出を蓄積し、評価へ結びつく中核モデル

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 15
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

class Student {
  + studentId: String
  + name: String
  + consentStatus: ConsentStatus
  + openTask(task: Task)
  + editCode(task: Task, content: String)
  + saveDraft(task: Task)
  + submit(task: Task)
  + viewEvaluation(task: Task)
}

class Task {
  + taskId: String
  + title: String
  + status: TaskStatus
  + promptVersion: String
  + rubricVersion: String
  + publish()
  + updateContent()
  + getSubmissionTarget()
}

class Prompt {
  + promptId: String
  + version: String
  + content: String
  + applyTo(task: Task)
}

class Rubric {
  + rubricId: String
  + version: String
  + criteria: List<String>
  + evaluate(submission: Submission)
}

class Submission {
  + submissionId: String
  + studentId: String
  + taskId: String
  + submittedAt: DateTime
  + submittedCode: String
  + finalStatus: SubmissionStatus
  + setSubmittedCode(code: String)
  + lockForReview()
  + allowResubmission()
}

class CodeLog {
  + logId: String
  + studentId: String
  + taskId: String
  + timestamp: DateTime
  + eventType: LogEventType
  + snapshotText: String
  + runResult: RunResult
  + recordSnapshot()
  + recordRun()
  + recordSave()
}

class Evaluation {
  + evaluationId: String
  + submissionId: String
  + taskId: String
  + status: EvaluationStatus
  + overallScore: Integer
  + feedback: String
  + processAnalysis: String
  + beginEvaluation()
  + completeEvaluation()
  + requestRevision()
}

Student "1" --> "0..*" Task : 課題を開く / 進める
Student "1" --> "0..*" Submission : 提出する
Student "1" --> "0..*" CodeLog : 操作ログを残す

Task "1" --> "0..*" Submission : 提出対象
Task "1" --> "0..*" CodeLog : 実施ログを保持
Task "1" --> "1" Prompt : 課題設定を利用
Task "1" --> "1" Rubric : 評価基準を利用

Submission "1" --> "0..*" CodeLog : 作業履歴を参照
Submission "0..1" --> "1" Evaluation : 評価結果を持つ
Evaluation "*" --> "1" Task : 課題に紐付く
Evaluation "*" --> "1" Rubric : 基準で判定する

note right of Submission
  保存状態と学習状態は分離する
  - 未保存 / 下書き / 提出済み / 再提出可能
end note

note bottom of CodeLog
  30秒スナップショット、実行ログ、保存イベントを記録する
end note

@enduml
